 the Ship for King Neptune","subtitle":"A maritime scavenger hunt unfolds during Sinbad Games","notes":"Follow the official shipwide clues and puzzles with your division; take part only through the supervised Sinbad Games program.","short_summary":"Divisions solve maritime-themed clues while pursuing King Neptune and the Golden Idol.","evidence_claim":"The academy’s 2026 Sinbad Games account documents the Hunt for King Neptune and the Golden Idol as a shipwide scavenger hunt involving clues, challenges and maritime puzzles.","source_url":"https://maritime.calpoly.edu/news/more-competition-sinbad-games","source_title":"More Than a Competition: The Sinbad Games","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2026-07-02","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"A supervised Summer Sea Term activity aboard Training Ship Golden Bear; follow shipboard boundaries and event instructions.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"cal-poly-maritime-push-up-off","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Push-Up Off","title":"Settle Division Pride with Push-Ups","subtitle":"Proper-form repetitions become an Olympics-at-sea event","notes":"Compete or cheer from the deck while event staff count proper-form repetitions; follow the organizers’ fitness and safety directions.","short_summary":"Cadets represent their divisions in a head-to-head proper-form push-up contest.","evidence_claim":"The academy’s 2026 account identifies the Push-Up Off as a Sinbad Games endurance contest decided by the most push-ups completed with proper form.","source_url":"https://maritime.calpoly.edu/news/more-competition-sinbad-games","source_title":"More Than a Competition: The Sinbad Games","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2026-07-02","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"Conducted as an organized shipboard competition; parti