our-second-june-22","source_title":"Our Second June 22","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2025-06-22","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"An organized Sinbad Games event aboard Training Ship Golden Bear; handling seawater and deck equipment requires staff supervision.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"cal-poly-maritime-boiler-suit-hydro-test","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Boiler Suit Hydro Test","title":"Turn a Boiler Suit into a Water Relay","subtitle":"Oversized workwear becomes division competition gear","notes":"Watch from the assigned deck area or participate only under event supervision; organizers control the suit, water and relay procedure.","short_summary":"Cadets use a boiler suit in a carefully organized water-transfer challenge.","evidence_claim":"The academy documented the Boiler Suit Hydro Test in both 2025 and 2026 as a Sinbad Games water challenge involving a boiler suit and division teamwork.","source_url":"https://maritime.calpoly.edu/news/more-competition-sinbad-games","source_title":"More Than a Competition: The Sinbad Games","source_kind":"university_official","source_published_at":"2026-07-02","source_fetched_at":"2026-08-13","latitude":null,"longitude":null,"maps_url":null,"access_notes":"A supervised shipboard relay; do not recreate it independently or alter protective workwear outside the organized event.","cost_status":"not_applicable","under21_safe":true},{"subject_id":"cal-poly-maritime-plumbers-nightmare","subject_type":"tradition","entity_name":"Plumber’s Nightmare","title":"Repair the Pipe That Refuses to Cooperate","subtitle":"Cadets confront a deliberately troublesome water system","notes":"Work with your division to control the water using the supplied setup and tools; leave pressure changes to the designated game assistant.","short_summary":"Teams race to manage water moving through an intentionally d